            "text": "This non-profit project documents an upcycling workshop at NORDER147, a creative space in Flensburg. The goal was to capture the vibe and show how simple sustainable fashion can be: transforming old clothes into something new with ease. I shot the event together with my friend Larissa, handling all editing and post-production myself. Since the workshop was organized by a friend (canim3denim), we volunteered to support the initiative. The result is a short highlight video that captures the creative community spirit and the best moments of the day.\n\n",
